{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“稳定丛”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"稳定丛"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>向量丛 (或"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚层","text":"凝聚层"}},{"Plain":") 的斜率 (slope) 是指度数除以阶数:\n$$\r\n\\phi(F) = \\frac{\\deg (F)}{\\operatorname{rank}(F)}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>称向量丛为稳定从 (半稳定丛), 是指其所有非平凡子丛的斜率都小于 (小于等于) 本身的斜率.</p>\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/stable+vector+bundle\" title=\"nLab [https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/stable+vector+bundle]\">nLab</a></span></p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"向量丛-投射模类比","text":"向量丛-投射模类比"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}